<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Manager Workspace — HosBank</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>

<body>

    <%- include('../partials/navbar', { user: user }) %>

    <div class="container">
        <div style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
            <h1>Manager Workspace</h1>
            <p>Welcome back, <%= user.firstName %> <%= user.lastName || '' %>. Monitor client portfolios, review pending requests, and resolve customer inquiries.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="quick-actions-grid" style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
            <a href="/manager/requests" class="quick-action-card">
                <strong>📑 Banking Requests</strong>
                <span>Review, approve, or reject administrative submissions</span>
            </a>

            <a href="/manager/complaints" class="quick-action-card">
                <strong>💬 Customer Complaints</strong>
                <span>Handle support escalation tickets and write responses</span>
            </a>

            <a href="/manager/clients" class="quick-action-card">
                <strong>👥 Assigned Clients</strong>
                <span>Browse and manage your assigned client portfolio</span>
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h2>Account Representative Responsibilities</h2>
            <p>• Process all client requests (RIB, PIN recalculations, savings accounts) in accordance with bank SLA protocols.</p>
            <p>• Provide timely, professional responses to customer complaints within 24 hours of ticket submission.</p>
            <p>• Audit assigned client accounts regularly to detect suspicious or blocked activity.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>